@startuml RF31_Classes
title RF31 — Filtrar e marcar o estado dos itens do acervo (favorita, disponível, indisponível, à venda)\nDiagrama de classes — entidades JPA reais (fai-domain) e enums
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E4DEF0
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods

package "fai-domain · model" {
class User {
  +username: String
  +displayName: String
  +email: String
  +emailHash: String
  +emailVerified: boolean
  +phone: String
  +birthDate: String
  +passwordHash: String
  +profileType: ProfileType
  +role: String
  .. +20 campos ..
}
class WardrobeItem {
  +user: User
  +brandProfile: BrandProfile
  +brand: Brand
  +name: String
  +category: String
  +subcategory: String
  +sex: String
  +brandName: String
  +color: String
  +material: String
  +sizeLabel: String
  +market: String
  +styleTags: String
  +occasionTags: String
  .. +54 campos ..
}
class WardrobeAvailabilityChange {
  +id: UUID
  +wardrobeItemId: UUID
  +userId: UUID
  +available: boolean
  +changedAt: Instant
}
class PieceUsageDiaryEntry {
  +id: UUID
  +wardrobeItemId: UUID
  +userId: UUID
  +usedOn: LocalDate
  +occasion: String
  +note: String
  +source: String
  +schemeId: UUID
  +createdAt: Instant
}
class HypeScoreCurrent <<RF49>> {
  +entityType: HypeEntityType
  +entityId: UUID
  +algorithmVersion: String
  +status: HypeStatus
  +score: BigDecimal
  +level: HypeLevel
  +dimensions: HypeDimensions
  +deltaPoints: BigDecimal
  +calculatedAt: Instant
  .. +12 campos ..
}
}
package "fai-domain · enums" {
enum HypeLevel <<RF49>> {
  LOW_SIGNAL
  NICHE
  RELEVANT
  HOT
  TRENDING
  VIRAL
}
}
package "fai-application · service" {
class "WardrobeService.ClosetFilter" as ClosetFilter <<record>> {
  +category, color, season, occasion, style: String
  +state: String
  +q: String
  +sort: String
  +page, size: int
  +hypeLevel: String
}
class WardrobeService {
  ~{static} HYPE_SORTS = hype, hype_desc, hype_asc, growth, rarity
  ~{static} SORT_ALIASES: Map<String, String>
  +closet(viewer, ownerId, ClosetFilter): Page<PieceView>
  ~hypeMinimum(level): int
  ~{static} stateMatches(w, state): boolean
}
}
PieceUsageDiaryEntry ..> User : userId
PieceUsageDiaryEntry ..> WardrobeItem : wardrobeItemId
WardrobeAvailabilityChange ..> User : userId
WardrobeAvailabilityChange ..> WardrobeItem : wardrobeItemId
WardrobeItem "*" --> "1" User : user
HypeScoreCurrent ..> WardrobeItem : entityId (PIECE)
HypeScoreCurrent --> HypeLevel
WardrobeService ..> ClosetFilter
WardrobeService ..> WardrobeItem : filtra/ordena
WardrobeService ..> HypeScoreCurrent : lê (sort Hype · hypeLevel)
note top of User : tabela users
note top of WardrobeItem : tabela wardrobe_items
note top of WardrobeAvailabilityChange : tabela wardrobe_availability_log
note top of PieceUsageDiaryEntry : tabela piece_usage_diary
note top of HypeScoreCurrent : tabela hype_scores — novo (RF49 · HypeScore v2)
note bottom of ClosetFilter : hypeLevel = faixa mínima (filtro, não aba) — novo (RF49)
note top of WardrobeService
  novo (RF49) — SORT_ALIASES: recentes→recent · mais_usadas→worn
  menos_usadas→least_worn · nome→name · preco→price · mais_tempo_sem_uso→idle
  (sort Hype e hypeLevel leem hype_scores; sem Hype fica por último)
end note
@enduml
